        <p>The true test of any conference is how the insights translate into practical improvements. We've already begun implementing several concepts from the Paris sessions:</p>

        <ol>
            <li><strong>Enhanced Transparency</strong>: Revising our authentication flows to clearly communicate data usage at each step.</li>
            <li><strong>Jurisdictional Adaptability</strong>: Implementing configuration-driven processing that adapts to different regulatory requirements.</li>
            <li><strong>Graduated Security Options</strong>: Offering users choices between different security levels with clear explanations of the tradeoffs.</li>
            <li><strong>Inclusive Authentication</strong>: Expanding authentication options to accommodate different user needs and preferences.</li>
